  "post_content": "<p>(18 fotos) Carnicer&iacute;a Rosa, la primera parada nada m&aacute;s entrar al Mercado Municipal de Onda por el acceso principal de la plaza de Espa&ntilde;a, te ofrece comidas preparadas artesanalmente por Pili y Manoli. Tambi&eacute;n carne de cerdo ib&eacute;rico, o cerdo criado con casta&ntilde;as, adem&aacute;s de ternera de angus o salchich&oacute;n de pavo sin gluten.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2021/04/IMG_20210423_103209.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Llevar 32 a&ntilde;os abierta y su abundante clientela es toda una garant&iacute;a.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarosa/IMG_20210423_103209.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210423_103209\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarosa/IMG_20210423_103221.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210423_103221\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarosa/IMG_20210423_104305.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210423_104305\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarosa/IMG_20210423_104725.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210423_104725\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarosa/IMG_20210423_104802.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210423_104802\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarosa/IMG_20210423_104819.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210423_104819\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarosa/IMG_20210423_104832.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210423_104832\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439e